# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

HireSwift AI is an intelligent Applicant Tracking System designed to simplify and accelerate recruitment for small businesses, startups, and growing organizations.

The platform will allow recruiters to upload multiple candidate resumes, automatically extract relevant information, create job descriptions, evaluate candidate suitability using AI, rank applicants, filter candidates using academic and professional criteria, and manage candidates throughout the recruitment lifecycle.

The system will combine traditional recruitment management with AI-powered resume understanding and explainable candidate matching.

The application must provide a complete recruitment workflow through a modern, responsive, professional dashboard.

The main objective is to reduce manual resume screening, improve candidate discovery, minimize repetitive recruitment tasks, and help recruiters make structured and informed hiring decisions.

**Core Product Vision:**

Build a lightweight, intelligent, and easy-to-use recruitment platform that enables small teams to manage their entire hiring process from a single application.

# 2. PROBLEM STATEMENT

Small companies and startups frequently receive hundreds of applications for individual job openings.

Recruiters often face the following problems:

- Manually reviewing large numbers of resumes.
- Difficulty identifying candidates with relevant skills.
- Inconsistent resume screening processes.
- Time-consuming comparison of candidate qualifications.
- Difficulty filtering applicants by academic performance.
- Missing qualified candidates because of manual screening.
- Lack of structured candidate tracking.
- Difficulty identifying duplicate applications.
- Lack of visibility into recruitment progress.
- Delays in communicating with shortlisted candidates.

Traditional recruitment methods do not provide an efficient way to manage large applicant pools with limited HR resources.

HireSwift AI aims to solve these problems through intelligent resume parsing, automated candidate matching, advanced filtering, candidate ranking, and recruitment pipeline management.

# 3. PROJECT OBJECTIVES

The application must achieve the following objectives:

1. Allow recruiters to upload multiple PDF and DOCX resumes simultaneously.
2. Extract candidate information automatically using document processing and AI.
3. Convert unstructured resume content into structured candidate profiles.
4. Allow recruiters to create and manage multiple job descriptions.
5. Match resumes with relevant job descriptions using AI.
6. Generate candidate matching scores between 0 and 100.
7. Provide transparent explanations for candidate matching scores.
8. Support academic, technical, and professional candidate filtering.
9. Automatically rank candidates according to job suitability.
10. Detect duplicate resumes and duplicate candidate profiles.
11. Manage candidates through a complete recruitment pipeline.
12. Provide recruiter analytics and hiring insights.
13. Compare multiple candidates side by side.
14. Generate skill-gap insights.
15. Support bulk email preparation for shortlisted candidates.
16. Provide exportable recruitment reports.
17. Maintain a responsive and professional user experience.

